{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 19, :comments ["<b>And you shall say to my servant, to Jacob.</b> To each one in turn — to the first, first; to the last, last — [you shall say]: 'Whom do you ask for?' — 'Your servant Jacob' — am I — and its Targum is דְּעַבְדָּךְ דְּיַעֲקֹב — and [if] you ask, 'And to whom are these before you?' — 'It is a gift sent,' etc." "<b>And behold, he too.</b> Jacob."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:01:46.659092882Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}